;; Swimming (a water area): the cartridge's JumpSwimTimer (ticks a stroke may follow another while he still rises),
;; its Whirlpool_Flag (he was in a whirlpool last tick: the next stroke is the weaker one) and the count whose low bit
;; times the whirlpool's sideways pull (its FrameCounter).
jumpSwimTimer.w = 0
whirlpoolFlag.w = False
whirlpoolTick.w = 0
; Which of the three swim pictures he is on (the cartridge's PlayerAnimCtrl while swimming: 0 to 2).
playerSwimStep.w = 0
;; The cartridge's pseudorandom register (PseudoRandomBitReg, smbdis 803: seven bytes, seeded $a5 at power-up, stepped once a tick
;; by StepRandomBits{}). The Bloober aims by it; the frenzies will too.
Dim randomBits.w(6)
randomBits(0) = $a5
;; The frenzy (UpdateFrenzy{}): its kind now (#FRENZY_KIND_*, the cartridge's EnemyFrenzyBuffer), its timer (FrenzyEnemyTimer) and
;; the heights it has used (BitMFilter, a bit each of frenzyHeights(), Enemy17YPosData: all eight are used before any again).
frenzyKind.w = #FRENZY_KIND_STOP
frenzyTimer.w = 0
frenzyHeightFilter.w = 0
