;; top of the block it grows from, vineHeight and vineTarget its height now and at most. playerClimbing is the cartridge's player state 3;
;; climbSpeedY the 1, 0 or -1 he moves by this tick, climbDummyY the carry of its movement force, climbSideTimer the wait before the
;; next swap of sides, climbAnimTimer the picture's step. climbAutoUp is the take-over above the status bar; climbAreaChange is set when
;; he has climbed out of the top of the world (the caller changes the area).
