;; Colour cycling. cycleColour(step*3 + 0 to 2) is the red, green and blue of step
;; `step`: the cartridge's ColorRotatePalette ($27 $27 $27 $17 $07 $17) in the
;; atlas's own colours for those (pens 4, 1 and 5): bright, bright, bright, mid,
;; dark, mid. paletteCycleStep is the step on screen, -1 until the first update.
Dim cycleColour.w(17)
