;; world number (their PipeEntry objects with a world in the link: one whose world has a level in the table starts it, the others are
;; inert), and whether its text has been drawn since the playfields were last stamped (0 not yet, 1 drawn). warpPipeTaken is the warp
;; pipe Mario is going down (-1 for none: a plain pipe), warpLevelTarget the level it starts once he is down (-1 until then).
